1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Welcome back to the channel, today we are talking about automation.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Automation can save you hours every single week without any doubt.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
But the biggest problem is that most tools are hard to set up.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
So why do so many people give up on automation before it pays off?

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
That is the question we are going to answer in this video right now.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:24,000
The secret is to start with a single simple task you repeat daily.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,000
For example, renaming a batch of files or sending a weekly report.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Once that one task works, you can copy the pattern to the rest.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Here is where it gets interesting, because small wins compound fast.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
So the next step is to pick your one task and automate it today.
